    "media:imagetext": "FLY-EASTERN AIR LINES\nMARCH-1954\nAPRIL—1954\nSun\nMon Tue Wed\nThu\nFri\nSat\nSun Mon Tue Wed Thu\nFri\nSat\n3\n4\n5\n6\n1\n2\n3\n7\n14\n21\n28\n8\n10\n12\n13\n4\n5\n6\n7\n8\n9\n10\n15\n16\n17\n22\n23\n24\n18\n25\n19\n20\n1 12\n13\n14\n15\n16\n17\n26\n27\n18\n19\n20\n2 l\n22\n23\n24\n29 30 31\n25 26 27\n28\n29\n30\nDon't leave them home!\nTake the family along\non EASTERN'S\n½ FARE\nFAMILY PLAN\nPurchase of one full fare Eastern Air\nLines ticket by one parent entitles\nother parent and all children ages 2\nto 22 to ride ½ Fare on any Monday,\nTuesday or Wednesday.\nOne child under 2 carried FREE. Children 2 to 12 travel ½ Fare every day\nof the week.\nThis plan does not apply on Aircoaches or on service to and from San Juan.\nMUrray Hill 8-8000\nAIRLINES TERMINAL BUILDING\nPARK AVE. \u0026 42nd STREET\nEAST SIDE AIRLINES TERMINZL\nIst AVE. AT 37h - 38th SIREEI\nEASTERN AIR LINES BUILDING\n16 ROCKEFELLER FLIE\n1407 BROADWAY\nLOBBY OF 100 BROADWAY\n200 LIVIIVOSION ST., BKLYN, N. Y.\nLA GUARDIA AIRPORT\nNEW YORK INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT\n(IDLEWILD)\nMItchell 3-5600\n11 COMMERCE ST. NEWARK, N. J.\nNEWARK AIRPORT",
